  "notes": [
    "ILLUSTRATIVE example. The values were copied from a production Vuetify app.",
    "inheritedFromVuetify holds Vuetify 3.7.18 base-theme or Material Design 3 blueprint values the app left in place.",
    "sameHexAsVuetifyBase lists app colors whose hex matches the Vuetify base theme.",
    "Missing on-* colors are filled at runtime and are not stored as hex.",
    "Some theme key names were specific to one deployment and are omitted. Descriptive names replace them. The hex values are unchanged.",
    "Logo paths and branding image values are omitted.",
    "A saved theme color in the source app is # plus six hex digits."
  ],
